    "created_at": "2016-09-07T20:27:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-07T20:27:34Z",
    "body": "I have no plans to touch this stuff in Gecko.  I doubt @sicking does either, since he's not currently actively working on Gecko.\n\nI, personally, am still opposed to changing this at all.  It makes no sense to me to treat data: and blob:/srcdoc differently here.\n",
