    "created_at": "2016-09-08T07:02:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-08T07:02:05Z",
    "body": "The attack vector is URL injection. Injecting a same-origin blob URL is hard as it would also require you to be able to execute script. You cannot inject srcdoc as a URL. Therefore data URLs are the only URL source that is vulnerable.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
