    "created_at": "2016-09-13T09:18:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-13T09:18:21Z",
    "body": "OK, so I will go ahead and LGTM/merge https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/1756 and https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/3663\n\nIt's still uncertain how things will work out for Gecko, but if making the change is Gecko is deemed too risky or is attempted and fails, then please check back here so we can look for some other way to reach interop.\n",
